          "docs": "Generate a video synopsis.\n\nSynopsis: A short, engaging, spoiler-free overview designed for someone deciding whether to watch the video. It focuses on the premise, intrigue, mood, and tone, but does not reveal major plot twists or the ending. It highlights the main characters and setup of the story, giving a sense of the emotional or thematic focus without detailing the resolution."
